    "id": 8778395287890,
    "title": "Five:Two Cleanse",
    "handle": "5-2-cleanse",
    "body_html": "<p>The 5:2 Pack is a weekly programme that promotes long-term weight loss without having to follow restrictive diet. It consists of eating balanced meals for 5 days and juicing for 2 days</p>\n<h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Cleanse Programme </h2>\n<h3 data-fd=\"dialog-content\" class=\"MuiDialogContent-root css-xprgmy\">10x 250 ml cold-press juices; 2x 250ml smoothie</h3>\n<h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Cleanse daily Programme :</h2>\n<h3 data-fd=\"dialog-content\" class=\"MuiDialogContent-root css-xprgmy\">5x 250 ml cold-press juices; 1x 250ml smoothie</h3>\n<div data-fd=\"dialog-actions\" class=\"MuiDialogActions-root MuiDialogActions-spacing css-dq6pzt\">\n<div class=\"budapest710\">\n<div class=\"fd-quantity-control removeItemButton budapest211 hasQuantity\">\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">1.Morning = Green Healer</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apple juice, avocado, kale, spinach, lemon (cold-pressed), spirulina, wheatgrass, chlorella &amp; nothing else </span></p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">2.Mid Morning = Shield Immunity</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Carrot, orange, turmeric, ginger, lemon &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">3.Midday = Hydro Green</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Pineapple, coconut water, spinach, kale, mint &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">4.Mid-afternoon = Ultimate Detox</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Apple, celery, spinach, kale, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">5.Afternoon = Drinkable Skincare</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Apple, beetroot, carrot, lemon, aloe vera and nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">6.Evening = Green Healer</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Apple juice, avocado, kale, spinach, lemon (cold-pressed), spirulina, wheatgrass, chlorella &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\"><strong>Allergen</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Celery</li>\n<li>Nut</li>\n<li>Almond</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
