  {
    "id": 8778382737746,
    "title": "3-Day Weight Loss Kick off Cleanse",
    "handle": "3-day-weight-loss-kick-off-cleanse",
    "body_html": "<p>The 3-Day Weight Loss Kick off Cleanse is a selection of low-glycemic juices that will help you to embark on your weight loss journey</p>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"MuiDialogContent-root css-xprgmy\" data-fd=\"dialog-content\">\n<div class=\"budapest532\">\n<h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">The Weight Loss Kick off Cleanse Daily Programme </h2>\n<h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">4 x 500 ml cold-press juices; 2 x boosters and 1 almond mylk as follows </h3>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">1. Morning = Happy gut</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Pineapple, celery, ginger, coconut water &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">2. Mid Morning = Turmeric orange Booster</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Carrot, turmeric, ginger, orange, lemon &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">3. Midday = Dr Green</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">cucumber, celery, kale, spinach, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">4. Mid-afternoon = Coco Water</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Pure coconut water</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">5. Afternoon = Gut Cleanser booster</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">Pineapple, celery, ginger &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">6. Late Afternoon = Ultimate Detox (Less Sweet)</p>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\"><span>Apple, celery, spinach, kale, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else</span></p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\">7. Evening = Green Healer </p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apple juice, avocado, kale, spinach, lemon (cold-pressed), spirulina, wheatgrass, chlorella &amp; nothing else</span></p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest38 budapest39 css-1a0zbu3\"><strong>Allergen</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Celery</li>\n<li>Nut</li>\n<li>Almond</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"MuiDialogActions-root MuiDialogActions-spacing css-dq6pzt\" data-fd=\"dialog-actions\">\n<div class=\"budapest538\">\n<div class=\"fd-quantity-control removeItemButton budapest214 hasQuantity\">\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2 budapest38 budapest33 fd-quantity-control__quantity-value budapest215 fd-quantity-control__remove-button quantity--visible css-1a0zbu3\" data-fd=\"quantity-control-value\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
