    "title": "The Green Curve Cleanse",
    "handle": "the-green-curve-cleanse",
    "body_html": "<h2>Green Curve Cleanse Daily Programme</h2>\n<h3>5 x 500 ml cold-press juices; 2 x boosters and 1 almond mylk as follows</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<strong>Wake up call</strong> = Keto Green (smoothie)<br>Coconut water (100% pure), avocado, spinach, kale, lime (cold-pressed), mint, matcha</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Morning</strong> = Beet glow booster<br>Beetroot, carrot, lemon, ginger &amp; nothing else<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mid Morning</strong> = Dr Green<br>Cucumber, celery, kale, spinach, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Midday</strong> = Ultimate Detox<br>Apple, celery, spinach, kale, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mid-afternoon</strong> = Coco water<br>Pure coconut water<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Afternoon</strong> = Turmeric Defense booster<br>Carrot, turmeric, ginger, orange, lemon &amp; nothing else<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Late Afternoon</strong> = Hydro Green<br>Pineapple, coconut water, spinach, kale, mint &amp; nothing else<br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Evening</strong> = Green Healer<br><span>Apple juice, avocado, kale, spinach, lemon (cold-pressed), spirulina, wheatgrass, chlorella &amp; nothing else</span><br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Allergen</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Celery</li>\n<li>Nut</li>\n<li>Almond</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><br></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>",
