    "id": 8771618079058,
    "title": "The Signature Reset Cleanse",
    "handle": "the-signature-reset-cleanse",
    "body_html": "<p>The Reset KOOX Signature Cleanse caters to beginners as well as regular cleansers. It aims to offer your resting breaks and short resets that can be used on a periodic basis to regenerate and to eliminate toxins</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Reset Signature Cleanse Daily Programme</h2>\n<h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">5 x 500 ml cold-press juices; 2 x boosters and 1 almond mylk as follows </h3>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\"> </p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">1.<strong>Wake up call</strong> = Hydro-Green</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Pineapple, coconut water, spinach, kale, mint &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">2.<strong>Morning</strong> = Gut Cleanser booster</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Pineapple, celery, ginger &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">3.<strong>Mid-Morning</strong> = Shield Immunity</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Carrot, orange, turmeric, ginger, lemon &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">4.<strong>Midday</strong> = Ultimate Detox</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Apple, celery, spinach, kale, lemon, ginger, parsley &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">5.<strong>Mid-afternoon</strong> = Coco water</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Pure coconut water and unpasteurised </p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">6.<strong>Afternoon</strong> = Turmeric Defense booster</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Carrot, turmeric, ginger, orange, lemon &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">7.<strong>Late Afternoon</strong> = Drinkable Skincare</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">Apple, beetroot, carrot, lemon, aloe vera &amp; nothing else</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\">8.<strong>Evening</strong> = Green Healer</p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apple juice, avocado, kale, spinach, lemon (cold-pressed), spirulina, wheatgrass, chlorella &amp; nothing else</span></p>\n<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 fd-text fd-text__body2-secondary budapest32 css-2kwxe2\"><strong>Allergen</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Celery</li>\n<li>Nut</li>\n<li>Almond</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
