    "title": "Ginger + Turmeric",
    "handle": "turmeric-immunity-shot",
    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"526\">Our Organic Turmeric Immunity Shot is a 60ml cold-pressed wellness shot designed to support your immune system naturally. Made with turmeric root, ginger, lime, coconut water and a touch of black pepper for enhanced absorption, this powerful blend delivers bold flavour and functional benefits in one concentrated sip.</p>\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"804\">Turmeric contains curcumin, known for its anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, while ginger and lime provide additional immune-supporting compounds. Black pepper helps increase curcumin bioavailability, allowing your body to absorb more of turmeric’s active benefits.</p>\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"956\">Cold-pressed and never heat treated, this turmeric detox shot retains maximum nutrients without preservatives, added sugars or artificial ingredients.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"996\">Why take a turmeric immunity shot?</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1165\">\n<li data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1032\">\n<p data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1032\">Supports immune system function</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1067\">Naturally rich in antioxidants</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1100\">Anti-inflammatory properties</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1128\">\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1128\">Helps support digestion</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1165\">\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1165\">Convenient daily wellness ritual</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">Ingredients</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1270\">Coconut Water (46%), Turmeric (33%), Lime (14%), Ginger (6.5%), Black Pepper (0.5%)</p>\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1281\">Size:</strong> 60ml<br data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1289\">100% organic ingredients. Nothing artificial.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1360\">One shot. Daily defence.</p>",
